{
  "name": "Indestructible Life",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You partake some of the true secrets of the Undying. On your turn, you can use a Bonus Action to regain hit points equal to half your maximum hit points. Additionally, if you put a severed body part of yours back in place when you use this feature, the part reattaches.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
